OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after police         
OL,4,Aofficer's neck cut                     
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after an       
OL,7,Fincident in Peacehaven which saw an    
OL,8,Fofficer have his neck and face cut,    
OL,9,Fpolice say.                            
OL,11,FSussex Police said officers were called
OL,12,Fto an address in South Coast Road at   
OL,13,Fabout 10:05 GMT on Friday after        
OL,14,Freceiving a report of a man making     
OL,15,Fthreats to kill.                       
OL,17,FThe officer was injured while trying to
OL,18,Fdetain a man at the scene and his      
OL,19,Finjuries were not thought to be        
OL,20,Fserious, but he was taken to hospital  
OL,21,Ffor treatment, the force said.         
