OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after police         
OL,4,Aofficer's neck cut                     
OL,6,FA 33-year-old man from the town was    
OL,7,Farrested on suspicion of causing       
OL,8,Fgrievous bodily harm with intent. He   
OL,9,Fremains in custody at this time, police
OL,10,Fsay.                                   
